ame></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA JUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIRABAYASHI TETSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAIWA RYOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAJIWARA SHIGERU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONISHI SHOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOZU KATSUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEMURA TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, JUNJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRABAYASHI, TETSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAIWA, RYOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAJIWARA, SHIGERU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONISHI, SHOJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOZU, KATSUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEMURA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thin lightweight battery pack for power supply of a portable electronic device. A battery pack (1) comprises a battery (3) and a battery protection device (8) between an upper case (2a) and a lower case (2b) that form a case (2). The battery (3) is packed in an enclosure (11) with positive and negative laminate plates, and thus the battery pack (1) is thin and lightweight. The lower case (2b) includes a thin elastic side (15), which is opposed to the battery (3). If the battery expands and increases its thickness, the elastic side (15) keeps flat, rather than causing the battery pack (1) to bulge. Therefore, the device using the battery will not be adversely affected.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Ensemble pile mince et léger pour l'alimentation en courant d'un dispositif électronique portable. Ledit ensemble (1) pile est composé d'une pile (3) et d'un dispositif de protection (8) de pile situé entre un élément supérieur (2a) et un élément inférieur (2b) qui forment un boîtier (2). La pile (3) est entourée d'une enveloppe (11) dotée de plaques stratifiées positive et négative, ce qui rend l'ensemble (1) pile mince et léger. L'élément inférieur (2b) comporte une face élastique mince (15) qui est opposée à la pile (3). Si la pile se dilate et augmente son épaisseur, la face élastique (15) reste plate, plutôt que d'entraîner le bombement de l'ensemble (1) pile. Par conséquent, le dispositif électronique utilisant ladite pile ne sera pas endommagé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>